{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Miner's Helm}}

When a [[Wax Candle|Candle]] is added to a miner's helm, it becomes a hands-free source of [[:Category:Light Sources|light]], perfect for use with a [[Pickaxe|Pickaxe]].<br>
It greatly reduces damage taken from cave ins while taking a penalty to its quality, often breaking it entirely. With enough max health and a good quality Miner's Helm, it's possible for a cave-in to not even KO you, dealing only SHP damage.

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Metal + _{q}Leather}{2} *  9+ {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.

==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
!Stat
!Formula
|-
|Wear
|<math>Quality * 8.5</math>
|-
|Deflection
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 2</math>
|-
|Absorption
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 4</math>
|}

==Notes==

*Once acquired, you can add a candle by right clicking on the Miner's Helm with Candle in hand. 
*To extinguish the candle, simply remove the Miner's Helm.
* As of update {{Patch|Burning Harmonica}}, this item is now considered armor.

